# MQ09 "Blood of the Divines". With the Bruma Gate closed (MQ10 > 50) Martin's greeting names the second item, the
# blood of a Divine (10). Jauffre gives the key to Sancre Tor (20). At its door (30) the player goes in, frees the
# four undead Blades (50 .. 53), whose ghosts lift the enchantment on the Shrine of Tiber Septim (55, 56, 70), takes
# the Armor (80) and gives it to Martin (90 -> 100).
# DRAFT from tools/live/quest_brief.py (2026-11-13): not run yet.

# Martin's greeting ("I've figured out another item ...", INFO 00026D58) sets 10. Jauffre's greeting at 10 ("So,
# Martin wants you to recover the Armor of Tiber Septim? ...", INFO 00036645) offers "What evil lurks in Sancre
# Tor?" (INFO 00036668), which sets 20 and gives MQ09SancreTorKey.
case mq09_martin_jauffre
run
player.moveto MartinRef
wait 120
approach MartinRef
talk MartinRef
until 600 GetStage MQ09 >= 10
bye if open
# From 16:00 Jauffre first walks his two once-a-day patrols out to the steps (JauffreCloudRulerRandomPatrol3 / 4,
# 30% each, TES4 Find packages) and then settles into the Great Hall (JauffreCloudRulerDefault). At test pace he
# crosses the hall and the door within a second, and a conversation begun mid-walk ends as he goes on (runs
# 47a / 47d), so the player talks to him once he has settled, as a player would.
until 3600 JauffreRef.GetIsCurrentPackage JauffreCloudRulerDefault == 1
run
player.moveto JauffreRef
wait 120
approach JauffreRef
talk JauffreRef
ask "What evil lurks in Sancre Tor?"
until 300 GetStage MQ09 >= 20
expect player.GetItemCount MQ09SancreTorKey >= 1
bye if open
end

# The door of Sancre Tor (REFR 00092E65, MQ09SancreTorDoorScript): within 300 of it at 20 sets 30; activating it
# with the key takes the key, unlocks it and lets the player in. The ride there is the player's travel.
case mq09_sancre_tor_door
run
player.moveto 00092E65
until 600 GetStage MQ09 >= 30
activate 00092E65
until 600 player.GetItemCount MQ09SancreTorKey == 0
end

# The first undead Blade (MQ09GhostBladeSpawn1): its death hands MQ09Script the ghost MQ09GhostBladeEntry, which is
# moved to the body and, 3 s later, greets the player ("At long last ... you have freed me.", INFO 00036647).
# "Who are you?" and "What happened to you?" each add 1 to MQ09.ghostTalk; at 2 "Is the Underking still here?"
# (INFO 00036667) sets 50. kill stands in for the fight.
case mq09_first_blade
run
player.moveto MQ09GhostBladeSpawn1
wait 120
run
MQ09GhostBladeSpawn1.kill
until 600 MQ09.ghostCount == 1
approach MQ09GhostBladeEntry
talk MQ09GhostBladeEntry
ask "Who are you?"
ask "What happened to you?"
until 300 MQ09.ghostTalk == 2
ask "Is the Underking still here?"
until 300 GetStage MQ09 >= 50
bye if open
end

# The other three (Spawn2 the Great Hall, Spawn3 the Stockade, Spawn4 the Catacombs): each death sets the next
# stage (51, 52, 53) once MQ09Script's 3 s timer runs out, and sends its ghost toward the Shrine.
case mq09_other_blades
run
player.moveto MQ09GhostBladeSpawn2
wait 120
run
MQ09GhostBladeSpawn2.kill
until 600 GetStageDone MQ09 51
run
player.moveto MQ09GhostBladeSpawn3
wait 120
run
MQ09GhostBladeSpawn3.kill
until 600 GetStageDone MQ09 52
run
player.moveto MQ09GhostBladeSpawn4
wait 120
run
MQ09GhostBladeSpawn4.kill
until 600 GetStageDone MQ09 53
until 300 MQ09.ghostCount == 4
end

# The Shrine (SancreTorTomb): with the player in the Tomb and each ghost within 100 of its marker, MQ09Script sets
# 55, then 56 and 70 five seconds apart; the barrier is gone and the Armor (MQ09ArmorofTiberSeptim) can be taken
# (MQ09ArmorScript OnAdd: 80). The four ghosts walk here from their own halls.
case mq09_shrine
run
player.moveto MQ09LastGhostWaitMarker
wait 120
until 7200 GetStage MQ09 >= 55
until 1800 GetStage MQ09 >= 70
run
player.moveto MQ09ArmorofTiberSeptim
wait 120
activate MQ09ArmorofTiberSeptim
until 600 GetStage MQ09 >= 80
expect player.GetItemCount TiberSeptimCuirass >= 1
end

# Martin: "Armor of Tiber Septim" at 80 (INFO 00026D6E) sets 90, whose result takes the Armor and sets 100,
# and offers "What else can I do to help?" (INFO 00026EF5, MQ08 and MQ09 at 100): the Great Welkynd Stone of
# Miscarcand (MQ12 10).
case mq09_give_armor
run
player.moveto MartinRef
wait 120
approach MartinRef
talk MartinRef
ask "Armor of Tiber Septim"
until 300 GetStage MQ09 >= 90
until 300 GetStageDone MQ09 100
expect player.GetItemCount TiberSeptimCuirass == 0
ask "What else can I do to help?"
until 300 GetStage MQ12 >= 10
bye if open
end
